== Country, Currency, and Region Reference

The table below records the ISO currency code and reporting region for every jurisdiction in which the firm raises invoices, pays suppliers, or reimburses staff. It is a lookup aid for claim preparation and for the correct selection of the fiscal locale in the Noice & Toit Expense Portal. It carries no entitlements of its own; the amounts that govern any claim are set exclusively in the chapters above.

