== Preferred Supplier and Partner Directory

The firm maintains framework agreements with the suppliers listed below. Framework suppliers have been vetted by Procurement, accept the firm's invoicing conventions, and route queries to a named account manager rather than a generic mailbox. Using a framework supplier is strongly preferred wherever one covers the relevant category and location; it produces cleaner receipts, fewer follow-up questions from the Expense Auditing Team, and a materially calmer quarter-end.

Engagement is by internal order reference, which the requesting team obtains from Procurement. Off-framework purchases in a covered category require a short written justification to Procurement and, once approved, become part of the supplier review record. The directory is reviewed twice a year; suppliers are added or retired by Procurement alone, and the Retirement of a supplier is announced with a wind-down window, never with immediate effect.

